content: No need to apologize — these are all great questions! Let me answer them:

**1. Do you always get a refund?**
It depends entirely on the price of the new shirt you choose:
- If the new shirt is **cheaper** than your current one → you get a **refund** for the difference.
- If the new shirt is **more expensive** → you'd need to **pay** the difference.
- If it's the **same price** → no money changes hands.

So the refund isn't guaranteed — it just so happens that the red XXL crew-neck cotton shirt is cheaper than your original.

**2. Can you split the refund between gift card and credit card?**
No, the refund can only go to **one** payment method. Also, per our policy, the refund must go either to the **original payment method** (your gift card) or an **existing gift card**. Since your gift card is the only payment method on your account, the refund would go back to your gift card.

**One important note:** An exchange can only be processed **once per order**. So once we complete this exchange, I won't be able to make any further changes to this order. That's why I want to make sure you've picked exactly the shirt you want before we proceed!

So, would you like to go ahead with the exchange for the **Red Crew-Neck T-Shirt, XXL, Cotton** ($46.85, with a $7.99 refund to your gift card)? Or would you like to consider a different option first? Take your time! 😊
